    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The girls are about to embark on a road trip...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you press a key, your car gains momentum. Reach a destination, and you\u2019ll unlock a new vehicle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether working, studying, or gaming... every keystroke helps the girls unlock new maps and continue their journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ready to ride? Let\u2019s go!!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple characters to choose and unlock</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828520/extras/a4e4c68d4e8f0d49aa3e8b0065da6ace.avif?t=1752634130\" width=360 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of cars to collect</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828520/extras/cedc19e5926f2d6c02adb3d2dcb0142e.avif?t=1752634130\" data-has-big width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828520/extras/9708ab11b9b22a4e5a4fcbcdf5ba8862.avif?t=1752634130\" data-has-big width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrive at world-famous cities and collect city postcards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828520/extras/669d72452fd163c066884dd35304f5d8.avif?t=1752634130\" data-has-big width=800 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828520/extras/6c486525c1df2d57914ebdf242a79241.avif?t=1752634130\" data-has-big width=800 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No extra effort needed\u2014just type and click as usual on your computer, and the car will drive automatically</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828520/extras/a3efb6335527ba2b4f0bf314b36285b5.avif?t=1752634130\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Car Drop Rates</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bronze Chest:</strong> 87% Bronze, 8% Silver, 4.9999% Gold, 0.0001% Diamond</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Silver Chest:</strong> 2\u00d7 higher chance for Silver or above compared to Bronze</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gold Chest:</strong> 2\u00d7 higher chance for Gold or above compared to Silver</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diamond Chest:</strong> 2\u00d7 higher chance for Diamond compared to Gold</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Other Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Relaxing gameplay<br>\u2714 A wide variety of cars<br>\u2714 Easy way to collect rare vehicles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Mode:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press [F4] to hide the interface and enter game mode.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The girls are about to embark on a road trip...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you press a key, your car gains momentum. Reach a destination, and you\u2019ll unlock a new vehicle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether working, studying, or gaming... every keystroke helps the girls unlock new maps and continue their journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ready to ride? Let\u2019s go!!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple characters to choose and unlock</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828520/extras/a4e4c68d4e8f0d49aa3e8b0065da6ace.avif?t=1752634130\" width=360 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of cars to collect</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828520/extras/cedc19e5926f2d6c02adb3d2dcb0142e.avif?t=1752634130\" data-has-big width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828520/extras/9708ab11b9b22a4e5a4fcbcdf5ba8862.avif?t=1752634130\" data-has-big width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrive at world-famous cities and collect city postcards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\